Package: cdfquant01reg
Title: Finite-Tailed CDF-Quantile Distributions for BRMS and Maximum Likelihood Estimation
Version: 0.2.0
Date: 2026-09-19
Authors@R: 
    person("Michael", "Smithson", , "michael.smithson@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The cdfquant01reg package is a wrapper for running finite-tail CDF-quantile distribution models in BRMS and with maximum likelihood estimation.  It includes the 32 original distributions and their 16 extended-support counterparts.
